@body

- Northern White Rhinoceros (N.Wh.)
  - KIFMPNSKERGPCNTHCCQGCDSIRNYKVI
- Southern White Rhinoceros (S.Wh.)
  - KIFMPQSKDRGPCNTHCCNGCDCIRQYKVI
- Black Rhinoceros (Blk)
  - KIFMPQCKDRGPSNTHSSNGSECLRQYKVI

